@MediSync.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5054

GET {{MediSync.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Login as Admin
POST {{MediSync.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@medisync.local",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Register a new Patient
POST {{MediSync.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test Patient",
  "email": "newpatient@medisync.local",
  "password": "Patient@123",
  "phoneNumber": "+1-555-0399",
  "gender": "Female",
  "bloodGroup": "A+"
}

### Get Current User Profile (replace <JWT_TOKEN>)
GET {{MediSync.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>
